  "http_notes": [
    "API58 source Server routes include the additive /v1/project-assistant-targets metadata catalog. Existing /v1/projects remains a separate intentionally empty legacy route; native readiness and production Cloud/device acceptance are separate.",
    "Route bot/offer IDs and captured machine must match body identities. Get/history/list queries are generated request shapes encoded as query parameters.",
    "Every write carries Idempotency-Key matching command.idempotency_key, rejects unknown fields, rechecks device/feature/source scope, and recomputes content hash. Never trust reader_id, SourceStatus or Capabilities supplied by the browser.",
    "Native capabilities are local attested facts; provider failure preserves metadata functionality.",
    "PA-05 registers the new routes with a raised APILevel and complete device/Cloud write gates; no machine-credential fallback.",
    "Own read/observed metadata uses fresh online readable authority; seven content operations require interactive writable authority. A source Project catalog option is metadata only and selected-directory resolution runs again before Create and execution."
  ],
